ntSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ac3-v36" target="ac3-v10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="75" y="1356"/><mxPoint x="75" y="234"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ac3-v75" value='&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; — black dot: initial node · bullseye: activity final · circle with X: flow final · rounded box: action · diamond: decision / merge with [guard] on every outgoing edge · thick bar: fork / join · convex pentagon: send signal · concave notch: accept event · hourglass: time event · plain box: object node («datastore», «centralBuffer») · small square: pin · dashed rounded box: «iterative» expansion region or interruptible region · solid arrow: control flow · dashed arrow: object flow / signal · "↯" edge: interrupting edge · "«exception»" edge: exception handler edge. Lanes: green = Gonarra role/component (SAD §3.1.1), grey = «external» system (SAD §2.5). No external call is made inside a database transaction (SAD §3.3.1); the Trips module is not invoked on failure, so the saved itinerary cannot change (FR-043).' style="fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1706" width="1400" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
